    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύρδην</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dragging,
				in a long line</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βαβυλὼν . .
				πάμμικτον ὄχλον πέμπει ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				54
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>as if dragged along, violently</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
				ἅπαντα . . ἀναλῶσαι δορί</span> E <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κονιορτοῦ ς. ἁπανταχόθεν
					ἐμπίπτοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					51(27).9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
